  "abstract": "This submission introduces neuron identity embeddings to the Shared-Neuron MLP baseline. Each neuron is assigned a unique, trainable embedding vector, which is concatenated with its temporal input before being processed by the shared MLP. This aims to allow the model to learn neuron-specific patterns while leveraging a shared processing architecture, with an embedding dimension of 16.",
